ional":"functional","essential":"essential","advertising":"marketing"}},"comp-jjkgpjeq":{"html":"<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Method</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">Saute the Arugula or spinach gently in the olive oil with the minced garlic and season with salt and pepper.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">Butter the insides of the buns and grill them on a flat cast iron pan until toasty.</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">Move bottom buns to a shallow glass casserole then place a 1/4 slice of each cheese on the bottom of each bun. Top the cheese with slices of <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#2B6CA3;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><a href=\"https://www.theglasspantry.com/smoked-pork-loin-roast\" target=\"_self\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Slow Smoked Pork Loin Roast</a></span></span>, then&nbsp;the top of the bun.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:18px;\">Warm the sliders in the oven set to 325&nbsp;degrees f